  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advanced Preparedness and Immediate Response to those Displaced and Remaining in Conflict Zones</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ltpgtThe conflict on the southern border of Lebanon&#xa0;has caused people to flee the area and seek refuge&#xa0;at collective shelters,&#xa0;sub-standard shelters, with host families, and&#xa0;other places. At the same time, many remain in the conflict zones and are experiencing an increase in needs.&#xa0;This project aims to enhance advanced preparedness and immediate response to support those displaced and those remaining in conflict zones. It will cover food security, basic assistance, and WASH sectors.lt/pgt</narrative>
  </description>
